  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Titan Pick\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Titan_Pick.png\" title=\"Titan Pick\"><img alt=\"Titan Pick\" border=\"0\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Titan_Pick.png\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Piercing\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Two-Handed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Slothful\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client weapon speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">85\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client damage coeff:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">1.17\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Titan Pick</b> is listed on the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-fighter\">Two-Handed-fighter</a> weapon list. Stats on this page come from that list and the Dungeon Runners client files.</p>\n<p>The client also has material-tier versions of this weapon (Cardboard Titan Pick, Celestial Titan Pick, Diamond Titan Pick, Iron Titan Pick, Obsidian Titan Pick, Stone Titan Pick, Tin Titan Pick, Titanium Titan Pick, \u2026).</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
